      "field": "course_content",
      "value": "Courses in biomedical sciences prepare students for careers in the field by teaching them about the structure and functions of living organisms, such as cell organisation and biological information transmission. Through hands-on lab training, data analysis, and learning how to use math and statistics to interpret biomedical data, they gain fundamental research skills.",
